#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid ""
"\n"
"Disable the automatic save of the web client:\n"
" - leaving the record (breadcrumb, menu, back button, links): ask to discard the changes or stay\n"
" - reloading or closing the browser tab: the browser asks before leaving, nothing is saved\n"
" - switching to another browser tab: nothing is saved\n"
" - record pager (next / previous) and New button: ask to discard the changes or stay\n"
" - editable lists: leaving the page with an edited row asks to discard it or stay\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Veb-mijozning avtomatik saqlashini o‘chiradi:\n"
" - yozuvdan chiqish (navigatsiya yo‘li, menyu, orqaga tugmasi, havolalar): o‘zgarishlarni bekor qilish yoki qolishni so‘raydi\n"
" - brauzer yorlig‘ini qayta yuklash yoki yopish: brauzer chiqishdan oldin so‘raydi, hech narsa saqlanmaydi\n"
" - boshqa brauzer yorlig‘iga o‘tish: hech narsa saqlanmaydi\n"
" - yozuvlarni varaqlash (keyingi / oldingi) va Yangi tugmasi: o‘zgarishlarni bekor qilish yoki qolishni so‘raydi\n"
" - tahrirlanadigan ro‘yxatlar: tahrirlangan qator bilan sahifadan chiqish uni bekor qilish yoki qolishni so‘raydi\n"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid "Disable Auto Save"
msgstr "Avtomatik saqlashni o‘chirish"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Discard changes"
msgstr "O‘zgarishlarni bekor qilish"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Stay here"
msgstr "Shu yerda qolish"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid ""
"Stop the automatic save of Odoo: records are only saved when the user clicks"
" Save"
msgstr ""
"Odoo’ning avtomatik saqlashini to‘xtating: yozuvlar faqat foydalanuvchi "
"Saqlash tugmasini bosganda saqlanadi"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid ""
"This record has unsaved changes. Discard them, or stay here and click Save "
"to keep them."
msgstr ""
"Bu yozuvda saqlanmagan o‘zgarishlar bor. Ularni bekor qiling yoki shu yerda "
"qolib, saqlab qolish uchun Saqlash tugmasini bosing."

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "Saqlanmagan o‘zgarishlar"
